          "artistic_gaps": [
            "Material and palette drift is material to fidelity: warm rose/rust stone differs from the reference's predominantly pale cream/honey body, regardless of the page's Rose stone subtitle.",
            "Intricate green-white reference inlay is reduced to a less legible tiled border; smooth satin center and polished stone response are less convincing.",
            "Mountain-to-lid transition, abrupt veining direction changes, soft hardware and weak ground contact reduce crafted-object coherence."
          ],
          "final_views": [
            {
              "file": "smoke/morocco/desktop-closed.png",
              "observations": "Body is substantially more salmon/rose, rust and ochre than the pale reference. Wood sides show strong stretched-looking grain. Green-white border is soft and difficult to resolve; mountain is small and abruptly seated. Uneven-looking dark lid seam, disconnected-looking small front fittings and weak grounding shadow merit review."
            },
            {
              "file": "smoke/morocco/desktop-open.png",
              "observations": "Dark brown underside and cavity obscure internal detail. Rear gap and layered/uneven rim strips at front-left and rear-right make attachment and join quality uncertain. Full model fits, slightly right-weighted."
            },
            {
              "file": "smoke/morocco/mobile-closed.png",
              "observations": "Complete chest and controls fit; title has little spare width. Tile pattern, mountain and metal edges look pixelated; small latch pieces merge. Dark front-left lid seam remains noticeable."
            },
            {
              "file": "smoke/morocco/mobile-open.png",
              "observations": "Full raised lid, upper hardware and lower corners fit without page overflow. Cavity remains very dark, ceramic motif is not discernible in this orientation, and rim/hinge edges are jagged."
            }
          ],
          "follow_up": "User must decide whether the warmer rose recolor and simplified tile/material treatment are intended. Retain partial unapproved status and the independent archive-byte hold; do not promote on the basis of intact framing or readable open/closed states.",
          "id": "morocco",
          "recommendation": "needs-user-review",
          "reference": {
